      "  Top 5 TFs:    ['NFKB1', 'RELA', 'E2F1', 'SP1']\n",
      "Mono:\n",
      "  Top 5 genes:  ['C1QTNF4', 'CLU', 'IGHM', 'RP11-1I2.1', 'IFITM3', 'AREG', 'MEG3', 'LGALS1', 'FCER1A', 'EREG']\n",
      "  Top 5 TFs:    ['SPI1', 'KLF4', 'GATA1', 'NFIL3']\n",
